      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Based on the current context, your habit streaks are not active. Here\u2019s how you can manage and start new habits:\n\n1. **Log Your Habits**: To maintain a habit streak, you need to log when you perform the habit. For example, if you want to track your daily meditation practice, you should log every day you meditate.\n\n2. **Set a Habit Goal**: If you are just starting a habit, consider setting a goal to help you stick with it. For instance, you might aim to meditate for 10 minutes every day for one week.\n\n3. **Use the Calendar**: You can use the calendar feature in LifeOS to remind you to log your habit each day. This can help keep your habit on track.\n\n4. **Review Your Streaks**: Once you start logging, you can review your streaks and see how long you've been consistent with your habit.\n\nWould you like some more information or assistance setting up a new habit?",
